# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in every checkout, on every OS.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks text out as CRLF. Tests
# that compare exact content then fail on Windows and pass on Linux: the
# published templates are held byte for byte to the code, and the vendored PDF
# worker to the installed package. Git detects binary files itself.
* text=auto eol=lf
